                <mxCell id="ohBox" value="🗂 OPERATING HOURS DB — built &amp; kept fresh in the background (not per request)&#xa;&#xa;🌐 Scrape public web / listings for each center&#39;s hours&#xa;✉ Email service centers asking them to confirm / provide their hours&#xa;↩ Replies &amp; scrapes update the DB · refreshed periodically&#xa;ⓘ Best-effort hint layer — constrains the slots a customer can pick (open ≠ available)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontColor=#3b5b8c;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
